cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use TLS Finder in your research or software, please cite
  the software (below) and, where appropriate, the original
  publication describing the method (see preferred-citation).
title: "TLS Finder"
abstract: >-
  TLS Finder is an open-source Python package for automated
  identification of tertiary lymphoid structures (TLS) from spatial
  immune-cell coordinate data. TLS Finder is part of the MOSAIC
  ecosystem for graph-native spatial biology.
type: software
